# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_1010029> (aleutian mink disease, human)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "MONDO:patterns/infectious_disease_by_agent") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:19961696") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_1010029> "A human disease caused by infection with Aleutian mink disease parvovirus.")
