AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_1060165> "ELANE-related neutropenia includes congenital neutropenia and cyclic neutropenia, both of which are primary hematologic disorders characterized by recurrent fever, skin and oropharyngeal inflammation (i.e., mouth ulcers, gingivitis, sinusitis, and pharyngitis), and cervical adenopathy. Infectious complications are generally more severe in congenital neutropenia than in cyclic neutropenia.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_1060165> "ELANE-related neutropenia")
